# Include guards

Do **not** use `#pragma once`. Use:

```text
__{TARGET}_{FILENAME}_H__
```

- **TARGET**: CMake 库/可执行目标名，大写（`qte_engine` → `QTE_ENGINE`，`qte_demo` → `QTE_DEMO`）
- **FILENAME**: 文件名 stem 大写（`engine.hpp` → `ENGINE`）；同目标下重名时加父目录
- 后缀统一 `_H__`（含 `.hpp`）
- 形如 `__…_H__`（双下划线前缀/后缀）为本仓库约定
- 既有 `include/qtheme/**` 公共头仍使用历史前缀 `__QTHEME_*`，勿为对齐目标名而批量改守卫

## Examples

```cpp
// include/qtheme/engine.hpp  (historical guard; target: qte_engine)
#ifndef __QTHEME_ENGINE_ENGINE_H__
#define __QTHEME_ENGINE_ENGINE_H__
// ...
#endif  // __QTHEME_ENGINE_ENGINE_H__

// examples/native_controls/gallery.hpp  (historical; target: qte_demo)
#ifndef __QTHEME_DEMO_GALLERY_H__
#define __QTHEME_DEMO_GALLERY_H__
```

## Enforcement

Not clang-format. Follow this Cursor rule when editing headers.
